{
  "boardName": "Unembed Demo",
  "description": "Where the forward pass ends: the stream becomes one score per vocabulary entry. Two layers of GPT-2 small run with an Unembed between them set to pass the stream through, so it reads the early answer after layer 0 and hands the stream on; the Unembed at the end scores it after layer 1 and lists, layer by layer, what the model would have said. With two of twelve layers the guesses are rough, which is the point: compare them. Fetches GPT-2 small (548 MB) once. Needs the hkp-python kept under the name \"python\", with the transformer extra (uv sync --extra transformer).",
